And now, everyone has been waiting for! "Kiki Lala Vivi" Birthday Commemoration 2026 merchandise is on sale!

775
01:03:49,149 --> 01:03:55,149
はい、え、かわいい！ちょっとじゃあ早速一つ一つ見ていきましょう！
Yes, um, so cute! Let's check them out one by one right away!

776
01:03:55,649 --> 01:04:14,149
1つ目は、こちら！ ビビとおやすみ抱き枕カバー！え、なんか、え、これこそ、やらしい、やらしいですよね！ビビ初の抱き枕カバーでーす！
First is this! "Vivi & Goodnight Dakimakura Cover"! Um, like, um, this is really, really suggestive, right? It's Vivi's very first dakimakura cover!

777
